{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udded <strong>Crew Perspective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Refocusing on a solo RPG experience, you now play as the <strong>sole surviving crew member</strong> struggling to survive.<br>Your character gains <strong>bullet hell shooting mechanics</strong> and a <strong>dash ability</strong>, with improvements to building, working, sleeping, and fishing systems.<br>Enhanced <strong>controller support</strong> and <strong>vibration feedback</strong> are added to provide a more immersive and tactile experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901070/extras/390725aeaddb27473119141dd792f35d.poster.avif?t=1753707969\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901070/extras/390725aeaddb27473119141dd792f35d.webm?t=1753707969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901070/extras/390725aeaddb27473119141dd792f35d.mp4?t=1753707969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Long-Term Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>level cap is raised to 100</strong>, with significantly higher stat limits, offering much more room for growth.<br>At the same time, daily consumption increases\u2014meaning you'll need to produce more food and resources to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901070/extras/78ded0c6fa03d938c386f22f1baf5149.poster.avif?t=1753707969\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901070/extras/78ded0c6fa03d938c386f22f1baf5149.webm?t=1753707969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source 